<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Ngindo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Akakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Paulo jukutumbula kwa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Akak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja Paulo jukutumbula kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha 1 Kolinto kiandikigwa na nndundame Paulo 55 kuboka pukuyoka Kilisto (Lipungu lya 1:1) Jenje nga balua ju kutumbula kati ja balua ibena ya Paulo itubinayo yenie Paulo akakiandikila kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto buku Kolinto. Iwechakine aandika balua jenje pakiba ku Efeso tango nu kuamuje katyangi ku Kolinto mumwanja gwakwe gukujenda nu kubuja Makedonia (Lipungu lya 16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua jenje nga majango ga mialo jombe Paulo jajipokile kuboka kwa akaamini bi likanicha kunhwalo gwa itendwa ichapu panakati ja bandu abunhwamini Kilisto, ikiba pamwe nu kukibagana pamwe na itendwa ya ngongola. Kilambo cha Kolinto chakamanyikana ku itendwa ya ngongola ku yene iomwangikije ati kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto ngibikilonda umwo. Uyo 1 Kolinto libi lipungu elimanyakina muno nhwalo gu kupalana (Lipungu lya 13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo bapatanga abali Akakolinto nu kunnumba Nnoongo kwa magambu gabe (Lipungu lya 1:1-9).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe ngalenganakia nhwalo gwaupatite gu kubaganika kwa bandu abunhwamini Kilisto buku Kolinto (Lipungu lya 1:10, 4:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kuboka penia ngalenganakia minhalo ja ngongola nu kupelekana mumabalacha akangweto kwa akangweto (Lipungu lya 5-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Kiboka pa genia ngababolo ku nhwalo gu kutolana, nu nhwalo gukupangi lilumbo inyago nu kugongale ni itoi ikihuke nu kuyoka (Lipungu lya 7-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajomolile kukupanga ilebe yukamula kwa kila mundu (Lipungu lya 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nenga Napaulo, nangemigwe kube nandundame ba Yesu Kilisto kukupala kwa Nnoongo. Balua jenje tuandika nenga na nnongo Sositenesi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ku kikuta cha bandu ba Nnoongo abunhwamini Kilisto ababi Kukolinto, ku bandu boa abajeguigwe mu Yesu Kilisto nu kemigwe babe chwapi, pamwe na boa abikema liina lya Angwana ana Yesu Kilisto kila paali, Angwana babe na bito. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Awawa bito ana Nnoongo na Angwana ana Yesu Kilisto bampegange upeele na tengela.</para>
  <para style="s">Kindimba Kunnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kila kingobu nannumba Nnoongo jwango magambu ga upeele gwampilingite mangweto kupete kwa Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gambu kukulondana na Kilisto kummekangite kube nu uwecho gwa ilebe yoa. Nnoongo ampi ilimu nuwecho gukutangacha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gambu nhwalo gwa Kilisto uchalakichwe kipola nkati jinu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>yene kipungukaje kitoi chachoa chela chikiuke kwinu mangweto anda mmi makalendela pabapakuekuligwa Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bombe mabampa makakala mpaka pukupela makabonekanaje na malemwa Lichoba lyale lya Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nnoongo juna kuaminika, jwombe ankemite mangweto mmegange kilebe chimwe na Mwana jwabe Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupwilikana kwa bandu abunhwamini Kilisto bu Kukolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa lina lya Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto, chonde nannyopanga nchikachane kwa kila kilebe channongelanga, makapwilikanaje kati jinu. Mmaganga kilebe chimwe, champala chimwe na mawacho gamwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, bandu bange bakachakwe Kaloe bannengile ilebe ilaya kube ubi bulwa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbakulenga yene, kila mundu kati jinu alonge gakwe. Jumwe alenga, “Nankengama Paulo,” jonge, “Nankengama Apolo,” jonge, “Nankengama Kefa,” na jonge, “Nankengama Kilisto.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bo, Kilisto ate kikibagana ikuta ikuta! Bo, Paulo nga ojwakabambigwa panchalaba kwa magambu ginu mangweto? Andaje makabatichigwa kwa lina lya Paulo? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nannumba Nnoongo kwa magambu nammatichije mundu jwajwoa kati jinu nambu Kilisipo na Gayo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mundu akalengaje abatichigwe kwa lina lyango. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Oho! Elo, nakammaticha Stefano na akalongo mundu, nambu mbikobakelaje kube nammatiche mundu jonge. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kilisto angingitije ne kubaticha. Nambu angingita kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone nu kutangacha kwenio panga kengama malobe ga bandu bina malango kupala makakala ga kiu cha Kilisto panchalaba gakabembuligwaje.</para>
  <para style="s">Kilisto makakala na gwambone gwa Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kunhwalo gwa kiu cha Kilisto panchalaba upuuchi kwa bandu ababilingite mukuoba, nambu kwito twenga tatubi mundela ja ukomboi nga makakala ga Nnoongo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gambu Majandiko Gachwapi galenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mbakualabiya malango ga bandu bina malango</para>
  <para style="q">nu kubeka pambwega ilimu ya bandu ababoligwe.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Babiko, bina malango? Babiko, aboli ba malagilo? Apundi kutaukana ba yaka yenjeno babi koo? Nnoongo abekite malango ga dunia jenje kube upuuchi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gambu malango ga Nnoongo, bandu kuotoje kummanya Nnoongo kwa malango gabe bene. Kinyume chakwe Nnoongo apala kakombolanga abaamini kundela ejibijibonanga bandu bina malango kube upuuchi, yani nhwalo ogututangacha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Akayahudi bapalanga kuingikiya iingi, Akagiliki bapalanga malango, <verse number="23" style="v"/>nambu twenga tuntangacha Kilisto ojwabambigwe panchalaba. Kwa Akayahudi kauchi na kwa bandu banga Akayahudi upuuchi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nambu kwa boa abakemigwe na Nnoongo, kwa Akayahudi na Akagiliki, Kilisto nga makakala ga Nnoongo na malango ga Nnoongo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gambu chikibonekana kube upuuchi gwa Nnoongo, kikweti malango kupeta malango ga mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Makalongo, nkombakelanga kingobu pamakemigwa, akajingi bakibangaje bina malango ata kukuwacha tu kimundu, ajingi bakibaje na makakala andaje bandu bina kujoanika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nnoongo aichagwi ilebe ibonekana nadunia kube upuuchi, kupala bakoye oni bandu bina malango, na ngagachagula gaga dunia eigabona kube gina kulegeleka, kupala kakoya oni bina makakala. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngachagu ilebe ibonekana na bandu kube yanga mbone na ina kubembuligwa nu kuiwachi kube yanga mbone, kupala kuialabia ilebe ibawachi bandu kube yambone. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nnoongo atela yene kupala akabeje mundu ojwaoto kulokaloka nnongi jakwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu Nnoongo mwene nga ojwammekite mangweto kube pamwe na Yesu Kilisto, Nnoongo antei Kilisto abe malango gito. Kupete jwenio twe tubekigwa kube tambone nnongi ja Nnoongo, tube tabandu bachwapi ba Nnoongo nu kombaligwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Anda pagalenga Majandiko ga Chwapi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ojwapala kulokaloka,</para>
  <para style="q">balokeloke Angwana.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kubambigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Akalongo bango panaika kachinu kuntangachilanga chili ja Nnoongo nalongije malobe matopeu andaje kengama malango ga mundu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kingobu panakiba kachinu, makalongo ngaamu kube andi jwangamanya kilebe chachoa chela nambu chache tu kumanya kiu cha Yesu Kilisto, ojwabambigwa panchalaba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kingobu panakiba kachinu nakiba negalike, nakalendema kwa mbwele nu kujoboka muno. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Undo yango na matangacho gango gakiba gakaalali banduje na kakweleka banduje nambu kuuchaili nkolongwa gwa makakala ga Uhuke jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Natenda yene kupala imani jinu jikunhyobale munduje nambu makakala ga Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Malango ga Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ata yene, twenga tulonge malobe gina malango kwa abakomalinge Kiuhuke, nambu malango genia ngiti ga padunia panoje, wala ga akatawala ba dunia jenjeje gambu benia babilingite mukuoba. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Malango ganeenga nga malango ga chili ja Nnoongo, malango agagikiite, agabekigwe kwa magambu ga kibumo chito kuboka pitumbulaga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Abije ntawala jwa dunia jenje ojwamanyi malango ganga, bakamanyi kabi babambiteje Angwana ba kibumo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Majandiko ga Chwapi galenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ilebe yangalibona lio,</para>
  <para style="q">wala lichikilo lyanajoaje,</para>
  <para style="q">wala mundu anawachaje umojo,</para>
  <para style="q">genia nga agabekite Nnoongo kwa abampala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Genia nga Nnoongo gatujogolile kugamanya kukupete Uhuke gwakwe. Gambu Uhuke kuingakiya kila kilebe, ata ilebe ya Nnoongo eikiite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mene ojwaotwile kuimanya ilebe eibi nkati ja mundu, uhuke tuje jwabi nkati ja mundu jwenio? Uyo Uhuke jwa Nnoongo tu ojwaotwi kumanya ilebe ya Nnoongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Twenga tupokije kiuke jwa padunia pano nambu tupoki Uhuke jwaboka Kunnoongo kupala atuotoye kugamanya gatupile Nnoongo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yene twenga tuboulaje malobe agaboligwe kwa malango ga bandu, nambu tuboula malobe agatuboligwe na Uhuke jwa Nnoongo, tukalenganikia ilebe yikihuke kwa bandu ababi na Uhuke jwenio. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mundu jwa dunia kupokeje ilebe i Uhuke jwa Nnoongo. Kwa magambu kwa mundu jwenio ilebe yenie yupuuchi, kuotoje kuimanya, gambu iotwi kumanyikana kukujangatigwa na Uhuke tu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwakweti Uhuke jwenio aotwi kumanya kweli ja kila kilebe, nambu mwene kumanyikanaje na mundu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Andi Majandiko pagalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Beneke abagamanyi malango ga Angwana?</para>
  <para style="q">Beneke abaotwile kaboula?”</para>
  <para style="m">Nambu twenga tukweti malango ga Kilisto.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mmanda jwa Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makalongo nenga nhotwije kulonge na mangweto andi nonge na bandu abakweti Uhuke, napaligwa kulonge na mangweto andi kulonge na bandu ba padunia, andi ilemba mulihyobalelo lya Kilisto. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mbaligwa kumpeganga mabele ngiti chakulya kijomoje gambu mmilingiti tango kukiotola. Na mpaka ngoe tango kukiotoje. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gambu mmilingite tango mabandu ba dunia. Bo, kweli kutenda kwinu ubi bwiu nu kutumbakana kati jinu? Ilebe yenie ilaya kipola kutenda mangwetumwe tango mabandu ba padunia, ntamanga tela na kitama cha dunia. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jonge panakati jinu alenga, “Nenga jwa Paulo,” na jonge alenga, “Nenga jwa Apolo,” bo, yene ibikulayaje kube mangweto tango makatama kitama cha padunia pano?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apolo nga meneke? Paulo nga meneke? Twenga takapakachi tatunnetalinga imani mangweto. Kila mundu akamwa liengo andi Angwana pabampile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nenga nakapanda mbeju na Apolo ngajitilila mache, nambu Nnoongo nga ojwaiteila imalike. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jwapanda na jwajitilila mache boa bambonije, jwambone nga Nnoongo ojwaitela mbeju imalike. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Penia kibije chikipetine kati ja abapandite na abajitilila mache iganukube kila mundu abakupokela hupo jakwe kengama maengo gakwe gakamwi mwene. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gambu twenga takalongo tatukamu maengo pamwe na Nnoongo. Na mangweto nga nng'onda gwakwe, mangweto nga nyumba jwakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kukupete upeele gwambi Nnoongo, nhotwile kubeka kijemo chambone andi nachengi bina malango, chenie mundu jonge aotwile kuchenga panani jakwe. Nakila mundu aba maha papakuchenga panani jakwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwaotwi kubeka kijemo chenge paali pa chache chekibekigwe, yani Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Panani ja kijemo chenie mundu aotwile kuchenga kwa jaabu na jonge kuuloi andaje maganga ga bei ngolongwa, aotwile kuchenge mikongo andaje maamba andaje manyai. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na gwambone gwa kila liengo lya mundu ubonekana lichoba lya Kilisto pilipakuekuligwa. Gambu, lichoba lyenie libakupiti na mwoto, mwoto gwenio nga ogupakupema liengo lya kila mundu kulaya gwambone gwakwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anda ibi liengo lya mundu elyachengite panani ja kichemo chenie liimbalile mwoto gwenio, mapata hupo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu anda echachengite kitinike, mmanya ipakuoba hupo yakwe, nambu mwene aiba akombwike andi mundu ojwaponiigwe na mwoto. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangitije kutenda mangwetomwe nga nyumba ja Nnoongo, na yene Uhuke jwa Nnoongo atama nkati jinu? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu ojwapakubomola nyumba ja Nnoongo, Nnoongo apakummomola mundu jwenio, gambu nyumba ja Nnoongo jibi chwapi, na mwenga nga nyumba jakwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mikikikoloyaje! Mundu jwajoa kati jinu anda akita jwombe juna malango tela nikitama cha padunia pano, mbaya abe ntokamau kupala abe juna malango ga kweli. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gambu malango ga padunia pano nnongi ja Nnoongo upuuchi. Gambu Majandiko ga Chwapi galenga, “Nnoongo bajonjanga bandu bina malango kukalamuka kwabe.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Majandiko gange galenga, “Angwana bamanyi kutenda mawacho ga bandu bina malango kuchataje.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mundu akalokelokeje bandu gambu kila kilebe nga chinu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paulo na Apolo na Kefa, dunia nu kulama nu kuwe, ilebe ya ngoeno na eipakuika yowa nga inu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu mangweto nga ba Kilisto na Kilisto nga jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Achandundame ba Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kila mundu atumanye twe kube takapakachi ba Kilisto tatukamuigwe chili ja Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chikipaligwa kwa mundu jwajwoa jola ojwakamuigwe liengo apaligwa kube juna kuaminika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ne kileje anda unhukumwile mangweto andaje jinhukumwi dunia, namwene ne kukihukumuje. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kumwojo jango mbi kutakiinigwaje ni kilebe chachoa chela, nambu mbi kubonekanaje nambone nnongi ja Nnoongo gambu gwa genia. Angwana nga abanhukumula nenga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yene makanhwukumulaje mundu tango nikingobu chakwe, nnekange mpaka oti pabapakuika Angwana. Benia bapakuumbula ilebe yowa iiigwe, nukulaya pukongolou agabagawachi bandu umwojo jabe. Penia kila mundu mapata lilumbo elipaligwe kuboka ku Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Makalongo genia gowa ganongila nhwalo gwa Apolo nu nhwalo gwango namwene, gabe andi kilandanikio kwinu, magambu gwa kilandanikio chango nenga na Apolo mbala mmanyange kilonge chenje, “Magabekange umojo agaandikigwe.” Kati jinu pakabeje na mundu jwannokenoke mundu jumwe nu kummembula jonge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bene abantei mwe makabe telaje na bange? Bo, Nnoongo ampije mwe kila kilebe chankweti? Kunike kulokeloke ilebe yenie andi inu mmene?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Anda mpatite kila kilebe champala. Tayali nkweti uloi. Mmilingite makangwana panga twenga. Elo, anda kweli makabi makatawala, kupala twenga uhyo tutawale pamwe na mangweto. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ne mbemele Nnoongo atubekite twenga takandundame kube tubandu bukujalaulika muno, andi bandu abahukumigwe komigwa, gambu tubi andi kinyepe padunia joa, nnongi ja akapakachi kuboka kumbengu na bandu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Twenga takapuuchi magambu gwa Kilisto, nambu mangweto kukulondana na Kilisto mina malango! Twenga tulegalike, nambu mangweto mmilingite na makakala. Mangweto mmi kuichimika nambu twenga tutenda kubembuligwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpaka ngoche tubi nanjala na nyota, tukwetije ngobo, tuputigwa makopi, tukwetije pukutama. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kabe tubi kulaga nu kamwa maengo kwa maboko gito tubene. Pututukanigwa, twenga kajopelanga kindimba, putuponjigwa, twenga tubi kuimbalila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda butukopakiye kajanga majango gichima. Mpaka ngoe bututendanga andi uchapu gwa dunia, na kwa kila mundu twenga uchapu tu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Andika ganga ngati kupala kunkoya onije nambu kupala nammolange mangweto andi makinangota bango banampaile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ata makabi na makomi elufu bukunnela mukutama kwinu na Kilisto, awabinu bamwe tu, gambu mukulondana na Kilisto Yesu nenga nga nanampotolinge kukutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwa yene nannyopanga chonde nnandane na nenga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nga magambu nankingite Timoteo kwinu. Jwombe nga manango junampala na juna kuaminika mukulondana na Angwana. Mainkombakelanga ndele jangengama kukulondana na Kilisto Yesu, ndela jamola kila paali mukikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto choa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bange kati jinu batumbwile kulokaloka bakitanga yene nhikaje kabena kachinu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anda bapai Angwana, mainka chokwe kachinu, penia ngapambakulola namwene, ngiti chabalonge angweto abalokaloka tuje, nambu uhyo na chache chibaotwi kamula. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Magambu Kingwana cha Nnoongo malobetuje nambu makakala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mpalanga chako? Inke kachinu na bokola andaje inke na mwojo gukupala nu kunyenyepala?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ngongola jilichapuya likanicha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jibi minhalo ja kweli ejilenga ibi ngongola muno kwinu mangweto na janapitije ata kwa bandu bangammanya Nnoongo. Banengile kube abi mundu ojwatyanga na aanaba awamundu! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nhwotolangabo kulokeloke? Mbaya ikabi kwinu ukokaleka, na mundu jwenio ojwatei kilebe chenie aboigwe kwinu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nenga, ng'anu kube kwa mmele mbi kutali namangweto, nambu kuhuke mbi upo pamwe namangweto na yene anda mbi upo, nunhukumwile mundu jwenio ojwatei kilebe chenie cha oni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kingobu pankongananga pamwe kwa lina lya Angwana ana Yesu, nane kitimbi pamwe namangweto kuhuke, kuwecho gwa Angwana bito ana Yesu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>mundu jwenio munkamuye ku Lichetani kupala mmele gwake upotekigwe nu uhuke gwakwe ukomboligwe lichoba lya Angwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kulokaloka kwinu kuchata kileje! Bo, mmanyangiteje kutenda kimela kachoko kunyelea libolonge lyoa lya unga? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mikijeleyange, makaleke kutali kimela cha lolo mmegange libolonge liyono lyanga jela kimela andi pampaligwa kube, magambu Kilisto, Pasaka jito, apangigwe kube lilumbo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tubeke mpapala gwenio ngiti kwa kimela cha lolo chelaje, kimela chiubaja na malemwa, nambu kwa nkate gwanga jela kimela, nkate gwambone na kweli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngununhwandakila mubalua jango makabe pamweje na akangongola. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kweli nga yene nakiba na mana kutenda akangongola boa ba paduniaje, andaje bachojoje, andaje bina lwina, andaje akagongale manhokaje. Magambu ikabi kupala kajepanga benia boa makapaligwa kuama padunia pano! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chaandike nga chenje, makabeganga pamweje na Nkilisto nngongola andaje jwachojo andaje jwagongale mahoka andaje nndumbakani andaje jukulobela andaje juna lwina. Mundu andi jwenio ati kulye makalye nakweje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bo, ne mbaligwe kahukumula bandu ababi panja? Benia Nnoongo mabahukumula. Bo, mangwetomwe mpaligwaje kahukumula ababi mulungolo lwinu mmene? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ababi panja Nnoongo mabahukumula Mammengange abe kutali mmaja jwenio.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuntakiana nnyinu Nkilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ajigabo jumwe kati jinu kuntakiyana nnyakwe ojwaamine kwa bandu banga mmanya Nnoongo kotoka kuntakiyana ku bandu ba Nnoongo? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bo, mmi kumanyangaje kutenda bandu ba Nnoongo mabijihukumula dunia? Anda ibi mangweto mpa kujihukumula dunia, kunike kupaligwaje kuhukumula ati ilebe ichoko ichoko? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangitije kutenda iganukube mihukumula ilebe ichoko ichoko ya machoba goa, matahukumula ati akapakachi kuboka kumbengu? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pammeganga na bulwa gwa ilebe ichoko ichoko, bo, mmi kakemanga babe achamahakimu bandu banga agabala bandu ba Nnoongo? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Oni mmene! Ikonda abije mundu wala jumwe kati jinu juna malango jukuoto kujomo malobe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Badala jakwe, ibonekana lubi lukobo nnongo kumpeleka nnongo gwakwe kamahakama, kabe nnongi ja achamahakimu banga nhyobale Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pibonekana ngumbi ya mmene kangweto jika nchipulinge! Bo, ikabije kilebe chambone kwinu kuboneligwa? Ikabi chwapije kwinu kupokigwa ilebe inu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu, badala jakwe mangweto ntenda kuboneligwa nu kupokonyola, kabe, genia goa matendelanga akalongo binu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Andaje mmanyije kutenda bandu akabaja balichije kingwana cha Nnoongo? Mikikikoloyaje! Bandu abatenda ngongola na abagongalela inyago na abatenda malaya andaje akalawiti, <verse number="10" style="v"/>akajibi na bachojo na bukulobela na ba kung'ing'iya na akapoki benia boa balichije kingwana cha Nnoongo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mmange makibanga yenie, nambu ngoe nnyeguigwe, mmekigwe kube chwapi, nukube bandu ba Nnoongo kwa liina lya Angwana ana Yesu Kilisto na ku Uhuke jwa Nnoongo jwito.</para>
  <para style="s">Mmele gwinu utumike kukunkoya Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu aotwile kulenga, “Nenga kila kilebe nyekataligwe kutenda.” Tela, nambu yambone yowaje. Nenga nyeketile kutenda kila kilebe tela kwango, nambu mbaije kutawaligwa na kilebe chachoti chela. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nhwotwile kulenga, “Chakulya kwa magambu ga lutumbo, na lutumbo lubi kwa magambo gwa chakulya.” Tela, nambu Nnoongo apakualibiya yoa ibena. Mmele gwa mundu ngiti kwa magambu ga ngongolaje nambu kwa magambu ga kabegele Angwana, na Angwana magambu ga mmele. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nnoongo ojwabayoite Angwana kuboka kabawile uhyo apakutuyoya twenga kwa makakala gakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangiteje kutenda mibele jinu ngi ipagwa ya mmele gwa Kilisto? Bo, mpemele nhotwile kutola kipande cha mmele gwa Kilisto kuubeka ube mmele gwa munkege nngongola? Napachokuje! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gambu andi pummanyi, kutenda mundu ojwatyanga nu munkege nngongola akilondana na jwenio? Andi piandikigwe, kulenga, “Nabenia akabena mababa mmele gumwe.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu ojwakilondite na Angwana aba Uhuke jumwe na benia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ntilange kutali na ngongola. Malemwa gange goa gatendigwa panja ja mmele, nambu mundu jwatenda ngongola atenda mabaja mummele gwakwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bo, mmi kumanyangaje kutenda mibele jinu nga Nyumba ja Uhuke jwa Chwapi ojwabi nkati jinu, ojwamapokela kuboka ku Nnoongo? Jwenio jwinu mangwetoje. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nhwemeligwe kwa bei ngolongwa. Nayene ntumiyange mibele jinu kukunkolea Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Konyakea nhwalo gwa kutola akege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nhwalo gwa ilebe yae einhwandikinge, mbaya ngoe mundu akatolaje akege. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ga ngongola mbaya kila munalome abe na aanamundu mwene na kila munkege abe na angwanamundu mwene. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Munalome alenganakie agapaligwa kwa aanamundu nu munkege alenganakie agapaligwa kwa angwanamundu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aano kutawalaje mmele gwabe, nambu angwanamundu kutawala, nu uhyo analome kutawalaje mmele gwabe, nambu aanamundu kutawala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kila mundu akannyimaje nnyakwe, kiti mpataninge kukingobu tu, kutenda genia kupala mpatange kingobu chu kugongalela, kuboka penia mmujilana kabele mumapatano ginu. Kwa ndela jenie mamulijepa Lichetani kunnyonjanga magambu gwangakamilika gwinu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ganannenge ngoe gangone tu ngiti malagiloje. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kweli kabimbaile bandu boa babe andi pambi nenga, nambu kila mundu apatite kitoi chakwe kuboka kwa Nnoongo, jonge chenje na jonge chache.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ngoe kwa bangatola akege na akanawele nannenge mbaya ikabi kutama uolo andi nenga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anda mundu kuotoje kuimbalila mbaya atole akege. Mbaya kutola akege kuliko kulokalela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa baba abatoline ngweti amuli, jenie jangoneje nambu ja Angwana, akege bakalekanaje na angwanamundu, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na anda atei yene, apaligwa kutama uolo, andaje achikachane na angwanamundu. Na analome bakapeje talaka aanamundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu kwa bandu bange nalenge nenga ngiti Angwanaje, anda mundu Nkilisto akweti munkege jwangaamini na ajeketile kujendekeya kutama na jwenio akampeje talaka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Akege Akilisto anda batoligwe na analome banga nhyobale Nnoongo, analome benia bajeketile kutama nabo akege benia bakalekanaje na angwanamundu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Magambu analome banga nhyobale Nnoongo benia bajeketeligwa na Nnoongo kukulondana na aanamundu, na akege banga nhyobale Nnoongo benia bajeketeligwa na Nnoongo kukulondana na angwanamundu. Na yeneje ata ingota yabe ikaba ichapu, nambu ngoe ngi ingota ya chwapi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Anda ibi, jwanga nhyobale Nnoongo jola apala kaleka angwanamundu Akilisto, penia, baleka tu. Penia munkege Nkilisto andaje munalome Nkilisto aba tengela. Magambu Nnoongo ankemangite ntamange kwa tengela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mwe makege Makilisto mmanyabo pangaje mpakakombola angwana binu? Andaje mwe manalome Makilisto mmanyabo pangaje mpakakombola aanabinu?</para>
  <para style="s">Ntama andi pankemigwe na Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu apaligwa kutama tela ni kitoi chabampi Angwana, andi apakemigwe na Nnoongo. Lyene nga lilagilo lyango kwa makanicha goa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anda mundu akemigwa na Nnoongo na kongo ainigwe, bai akakopakeaje kube jwanga inigwa, anda akemigwa tango nu kuinigwaje, bai akainigwaje. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gambu kuinigwa andaje gwangainigwa kile chamboneje, nambu chambone kengama malagilo ga Nnoongo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kila mundu aigale uhyo andi apakemigwa na Nnoongo <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bo, mwe apankema Nnoongo makiba mabanda? Tela, makajalije, nambu andampatite uwecho gukube tengela mutumie gwenio. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Gambu ojwakemigwe na Angwana ata akabi mmanda jwenio aba tengela jwa Angwana. Uhyo na mundu ojwakemigwe jwatengela, aba mmanda jwa Kilisto. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Magambu Nnoongo anhwemalinge mmoa kwa bei ngolongwa, yene makabeje kabele makabanda ba bandu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Makalongo bango kila mundu aigale uhyo andi apakemigwa na Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa banga tola akege na akinanhwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nhwalo gwa achikabale na bangatolana na akinalome ngwetije amuli kuboka ka Angwana, nambu nampeganga mawacho gango nenga kwa kia ja Angwana mbaligwa kuaminika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Magambu gwa malola agabi ngoeno mbaya mundu atame uhyo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bo, nkweti akege? Bai, makajigaje kaleka benia. Bo, ntoije akege? Makatolaje akege. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu anda ntoi akege nnemwiteje, nakamwale anda atoligwe nanalome alemwiteje. Angweto abapakutolana bapakupata malola ga dunia jenje, nambu nenga napaije gampatange malola andi agabapatanga abatoline.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Makalongo mbala kunnenge yene, kingobu chikiigile kichoko tu. Na mpaka ngoe abatoline babegange andi bangatolana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Abaguta babe andi bangaguta, abaala mojo babe andi banga ala mojo, abaemela babe andi banga kola ilebe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abakweti liengo padunia pano babegange andi babi kuliagabaje. Gambu dunia jeno andi putujimanyi jitendakupeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pambailage makabe na mbweleje. Mundu jwanga akege abegele liengo lya Angwana pabapa kaalalila Angwana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu munalome ojwatoi akege abegele ni ilebe ya dunia pabapa kaalalila aanamundu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>na benia bikibagine. Munkege jwangatoligwa na analome andaje nhwenja abegele ni ilebe ya Angwana apange mmele gwakwe nu uhuke gwakwe kutama kwa Chwapi ka Angwana. Nambu munkege ojwatoligwe nanalome abegele ni ilebe ya dunia jenje bakakonjale angwanamundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nannenge genia mbala kunyangatanga. Ngiti kupala kunkanakiaje. Mbala mmegange ni kijemo cha mbone, mmaganga na limwe kwa mojo kabegelela Angwana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anda mundu alola atenda gamboneje kunneka munkege jwankobike, nukuimbali chepa mbaya antole, wala atenda malemwaje kuntola. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nambu anda mwene munalome abi lachi akatolanaje nu munkege na aotwi kuimbalila mmanya atenda gambone nukutolaje. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ku yenie, jwajo ojwatola akege atenda gambone, na jwajo jwangatola akege atenda gambone muno. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Munkege ojwatoligwe atabigwe na angwanamundu kwa machoba goa gababi angwanamundu bomi. Nambu anda angwanamundu bajomwike, amama benia babi tengela, na anda bapaile baotwile kutolana na analome nambu babe Akilisto. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nambu panola nenga ikabi mbaya kutama uhyo. Genia gango nenga, mbemele nanenga ngweti Uhuke jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yakulya ikugongalela mahoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ngoe ku nhwalo gwa yakulya ikugongalela mahoka, tumanyi kutenda twenga tuboa tukweti upundi, nambu upundi gwenio gwabeka bandu kulokaloka nambu mapalano kuchenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ojwapemele kube amanyi kilebe jwenio amanyije andi apipaligwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambu ojwampala Nnoongo jwenio amanyakine na jwenio.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa yenie nhwalo gwa yakulya ibagongali mahoka, tumanyi kutenda mahoka kilebe chamboneje padunia na tumanyi kutenda Nnoongo jumwe tu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ata ikabi ilebe ikemigwa milongo padunia andaje kumbengu na ata jikabi milongo na akangwana ajingi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>yene abi Nnoongo jumwe tu, Awawa, Chapanganya jwa ilebe yoa, kwa kupala kwabe twe tubile. Nu uhyo babi Angwana bamwe tu, ana Yesu Kilisto benia kwa ndele jabe ilebe yoa ngipanganigwa na twe tutama kwa ndela jabe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu bandu boaje abamanyi kweli jenie. Gambu babi bandu bange abayobali mahoka, bandu benia mpaka ngoe apabalyeganga yakulya yenie bibonanga tango andi yakulya igongaligwe kwa mahoka. Gambu balegalike lihyobalelo, bapata kinyela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu chakulya kuotoje kutubeka kube papipi na Nnoongo. Anda tukilekite tupungukaje ni kilebe chachoa, anda tulile kutujonjakeaje kilebe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambu mma maha, tengela jinu jakatendaje abalegalike imani kugwe mumalemwaje. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gambu mundu jwalegalike lihyobalelo, anda amweni mwenga mankomi lihyobalelo makalya yakulya yenie pikitembe cha mahoka, bo, mabeje na mwojo gukulye yakulya igongaligwe kwa mahoka? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yene Nkilisto nnyinu jwenio jwanga komala lihyobalelo Kilisto ngawe kwa magambo ga jwenio, apakuoba kwa magambu ga kumanya kwinu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwa ndela jenie mpakutendanga malemwa kwa Kilisto kwa kagwiyanga akalongo Akilisto abalegelike mwojo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda yakulya yammeka nnongo gwango kugwe mumalemwa bai ndyeje nyama manammeke nnongo gwango kugwe mumalemwa.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kupaligwa na maengo ga ndundame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bo, nenga ngwetije tengela? Bo, ne nandundameje? Bo, ne nabwenije Angwana bito ana Yesu? Bo, mangwetomwe nhwaminingeje kwa magambu ga liengo lyango Kangwana? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ata ikabi bange kunyeketeje nenga kube nandundame, nambu kwinu mangweto ne nandundame. Mangwetomwe nga maunayanga ne kube nandundame kwa magambu gwa kulondana kwinu na Angwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yene nga panyanga kwa bandu boa abangonya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bo, tupaligweje twe kulye nu kunywe? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bo, tupaligweje kuntola munkege Nkilisto mumyanja jito, andi achandundame bange pabatendanga na akanuna ba angwana nu uhyo na Kefa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Andaje ne na Banaba tu tatupaligwe kupata mapungu kwa maengo gito? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bo, lityala lyako elilikilepa lyene kwa maengo gakwe kukigono cha matyala? Nnemi ni jwangalye yakulya ya munng'onda gwakwe? Nchungi gani jwanganywee mabeele ga ilangwa yakwe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bo, ilebe yenje nonge kimundumundu? Malagilo ga Musa galenga yeneje? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Malagilo ga Musa galenga, “Makantabaje kano ng'ombe papuluya mbonji.” Bo ikonda Nnoongo abegelela na ng'ombe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bo, atuwachije twenga apalenga geniaga? Genia gaandikigwa kwa magambu gito twenga, gambu ojwalema na ojwauna boa akabele bapaligwe kuhyobalela kupata lipungu lyabe lya mauno. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Anda twenga tupandite mbeju ikihuke kwinu, bo, ubaja anda tutoi kwinu nyonjakea ya padunia? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Anda bange bahyobale kupata genia kuboke kwinu mangweto, bo, twenga tupaligweje kupata kupeta angweto? Nambu twenga tutumije genia. Nambu, tutela kuimbalila goa kupala tukuwibije Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Kilisto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bo mmanyangiteje kutenda ababijibegelela Nyumba ja Nnoongo bapatanga chakulya chabe pa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, na abapangi lilumbo pikitembe cha Nnoongo bapata lipungu lya lilumbo lyenie? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Angwana balagila uhyo, akatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone bapatange chakulya chabe kupete mwenio.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu nenga ndumiije panapaligwe na wala andika ganga mbate je. Kwango nenga mbaya kujomoka mbaije kunnaya mundu kube ndenda kukiluya jagi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anda ndangacha Nhwalo Gwambone, mbaligwaje kukikoya. Lyenie nga liengo lyambaligwe ukamula. Mbakulaga anda nukutangachaje Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Liengo lende nakachagwi kwa mele, kabi hyobalile lipungu, nambu ngamwa kwa magambu Nnoongo annengi ngamule, penia pabi namana liengo lyambaligwa kamula. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lipungu lyango nike? Lipungu lyango uwecho gukutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone bule, nakalongaje lipungu andi pambaligwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nenga nabandaje ba mundu jwajwoa, nambu nikibekite mbe nabanda ba bandu boa kupala nampe Kilisto bandu ajingi anda iwechekine. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa Akayahudi natama andi Nayahudi kupala kapata Akayahudi, iganukube ne mbije Mumalagilo ga Musa, nikibeka kube pamwe nabo Mumalagilo ga Musa kupala kapata ababi Mumalagilo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa bangabe Mumalagilo ga Musa, ndama andi angweto banga Malagilo. Kupala napate ababi panja ja Malagilo. Ngiti mbije Mumalagilo ga Nnoongo ije, gambu mbi Mumalagilo ga Kilisto. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa bandu abalegalike nane kulegaleka uhyo kupala kapata bandu abalegalike. Nikitei kube kila kilebe kwa bandu boa kupala kakombola kati jabe anda iwechakine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngamwa genia goa kwa magambu ga Nhwalo Gwambone, kupala mbate kindimba chakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyi kutenda ababutuka mbelo kupetana kupala kupata lilumbo, nambu mundu jumwe tu ojwapata lilumbo? Na mwe uhyo mpaligwa kubutuka andi angweto. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ababutuka mbelo bikibeke chalia ngolongwa, batendange yene kupala bapate hupo eialabika! Nambu twenga tutenda genia tupate hupo yangaalabika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nga kwamana mutuka yene kupala nhotole, ngapambutana, ngiti andi ojwaputa lingumi panyengelejagije. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nuhyobeleke mmele gwango mukomo nkolongwa, kupala namwene nakakanigwaje kuboka pakatangachila bange.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kelebuya nhwalo gwa mahoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makalongo nkombakelanga kutenda akaokobito pabakiba na Musa balendeligwa na liunde na boa ngabajomboka baali kwa tengela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kukubeganga nhwina ja liunde nu kukubeganga nkati ja baali boa ngababatichigwa kube pamwe na Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Boa ngabalyaganga chakulya uchache chikihuke. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na ngabanyweganga kinywagi uchache chikihuke, gambu ngabanyweganga kuboke mulibwe lya kiuhuke elyabakengamaga, libwe lyenie likiba Kilisto mwene. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ata yene bandu bange bankonjalije Nnoongo, ngabaweganga papongote.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ilebe yene yoa kilandanakiyo tu kwito, tukakamuje mabaja andi angweto pabatendaga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Makagongaleje mahoka andi bange pabatendaga, andi Majandiko pagalenga, “Bandu ngabatamanga kulye nu kunywe, ngabajema kuina.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wala tukatenda ngongolaje andi apabatendaga bandu bange, ngabaweganga lichoba limwe bandu elufu ichilini na tatu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Takategaje Angwana andi bandu bange ngabatega ngabaweganga na majoka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Takakoolaje andi bange ngabatenda yenie ngabakomigwa na Nkomi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ilebe yene yoa ipitila kupala kulandanakiya kubange, na gaandikigwa kupala kutukelebuya tatubi padunia ejipela. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Abapemele bajemite tela babe maha bakagweje. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kulondoligwa kunnondoligwe nga kwa machoba goa kwa bandu boa. Nambu Nnoongo juna kuaminika, jwombe annekaje nnondoligwe kagapeta makakala ginu, iganukube kubi kulondoligwa, jwombe ampeganga makakala gukuimbalila na ndela ja kuboka mwenio tegatega.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yenie makalongo bango nkotokange kugongalela mahoka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nonge namangweto andi bandu bina malango, nhwachanga mmene genia agannongile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Putunnumba Nnoongo kukikombe chache chikindimba, bo, tubi kukilondaje na myai ja Kilisto? Putumetu nkate bo, tubi kukilondaje na mmele gwa Kilisto? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Magambu nkate gwenio nga gumwe tu, iganukube twe, tubi ndu, tubi mmele gumwe, gambu tuboa tulye nkate ugwo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Maachanga bandu ba Kuisilaeli bene, abalyeganga malumbo bikilonda pikitembe cha Nnoongo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nenga bole? Chakulya chikilumbigwa kwa mahoka chambone kupeta mahoka? Andaje bo, mahoka gambone? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ije napachokuje! Chanenga yene lilumbo lyabalumba bandu bangammanya Nnoongo bagape mahoka, ngiti Nnoongoje. Ne mbaije mangweto mikilonde na mahoka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mangweto mpaligweje kunywela kikombe chimwe na Angwana kuboka penia kunywe pamwe na mahoka, mpaligweje kutama pamecha ja Angwana na pamecha ja mahoka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Andaje tupala kabeka bwiu Angwana? Nkita tukweti makakala muno kapeta beniabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ilebe yoa ijekatiligwe kamula nambu yoaje yambone. Ilebe yoa ijekatiligwe nambu yoaje eichenga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mundu akabegele ilebe yakweje nambu ya jonge. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yoa iuchigwa kuchoko nhwotwile kulye nambu makakonyakonyaje kwa magambu ga kulegaleka mojo kwinu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwito twenga majandiko galenga, “Dunia na ilebe yoa nga ya Angwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Anda mundu jwanga amini ankokite kulye na mangweto nnyeketile kujenda makalya yowa ibekigwe kwinu makakonyakonyaje kwa magambu ga kulegeleka mojo kwinu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu anda mundu annengi kita chakulya chenje kipangigwe kwa mahoka, makalyeje kwa magambu ga ojwannengile na kwa magambu ga kulegeleka mojo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nenga, “magambu ga kulegeleka mwojo,” ngiti myojo jinuje, nambu mwojo gwa jwenio ojwannengalinge. Kwanike tengela jango ihyobalele mwojo gwa mundu jonge? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Anda ibi nenga ndye chakulya kukunnumba Nnoongo mboni ndukanigwa magambu gwa chakulya na kongo nannumbite Nnoongo? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yene chachoa chankamula, chachoa channie andaje kunywe, ntenda genia ku kibumo cha Nnoongo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Makauchije Akayahudi andaje Akagiliki andaje bandu ba likanicha lya Nnoongo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mma andi nenga, nyiga kalenganakiya bandu boa, kwa kila ndela, panga palapala nyonjakea jango namwene nambu nyonjakea ja bandu boa, bakomboligwe.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Unyigange nenga andi ne panannyiga Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuekele mutwe kingobu cha kugongalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nannumbalilanga magambu umbikungombakela na mmi kugakamula gaga ganannagilaga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambu mbala mmanyange kutenda Kilisto nga mutwe gwa kila munalome, na munalome nga mutwe gwa aanamundu, na Nnoongo nga mutwe gwa Kilisto. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na kila munalome ojwagongalela andaje kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo na kongo aekalile mutwe, anyalau Kilisto. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na munkege ojwagongalela andaje kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo na kongo kuekelelaje luchunge umutwe, babembu angwanamundu, ojwatenda yene tela tu na munkege ojwachekwile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Munkege jwanga ekele mutwe gwakwe mbaya achekule nywili yakwe. Anda munkege alola oni kubota nywili yakwe andaje kuchekula, mbaya aekele mutwe gwakwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kualaje munalome kuekele mutwe gwakwe, magambu jwenio ngi kilandanakio na Nnoongo nalindala lya kibumo cha Nnoongo, na munkege nga lindala lya kibumo cha angwana mundu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Munalome apitila kumunkegeje, nambu munkege apitila kumunalome. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Munalome apanganigwa kwa magambu ga munkegeje nambu munkege apanganigwa kwa magambu ga munalome. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nga kwa mana munkege aekele mutwe gwakwe, kupala kiingi chi kinala echikibi panani jakwe, uhyo gambu ga akapakachi bukumbengu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na yene nnongi ja Angwana munkege kilebeje panga analome, uhyo analome nnongi ja Angwana kilebije panga munkege.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Andi yene munkege papitila kumunalome, uhyo munalome abelekwa kwa munkege, ilebe yoa ipiti ku Nnoongo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nnyomolanga mmene makangweto, bo, chwapi munkege annyope Nnoongo kongo nu kuekeleje mutwe? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bo, kibelekwa chene kibi kulayaje kipola kutenda munalome anda akweti nywili ndu oni mwene? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu ku munkege kube na nywili ndu kibumo kwakwe, nywili yakwe ndu apatite kupala inhwekelele. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anda mundu atenda kutauka kilebe chenjeno, bai amanya kutenda twenga tukwetije lukobo longe, na makanicha ga Nnoongo gakwetije lukobo longe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kongo mbi tango nampaganga malagilo ganga, nannumbalilangaje magambu gwa ganga, ngongano inu mangweto Makakilisto yammekanga mumabaja kupeta gambone. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nyoa, kutenda pankongananga pamwe andi likanicha kupiti kupwilikana panakati jinu. Nane kuwamini kachoko, <verse number="19" style="v"/>gambu kulekana mawacho mpaka kupitile kwinu, kupala ababi tela bamanyikane. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kweli, mmi kongananga, nambu magambu gu kulye chakulya cha Angwanaje, <verse number="21" style="v"/>gambu pannieganga kila mundu kikitamalila chakulya chakwe mwene, bange kuba nanjala na bange balobile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bo, nkwetingitije kachinu kukunywe nukulye? Andaje bo, milibembula likanicha lya Nnoongo na kabeka oni angweto bangakola kilebe? Nannengalanga nike? Nannumbalile? Ije napachokuje! Kunhwalo gongoje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gambu nenga napokela Kangwana malagilo ganannekalinge, kutenda uwiku gwago pabapangigwa Angwana ana Yesu, ngabatola nkate, <verse number="24" style="v"/>ngalumba, ngabametula ngabalenga, “Gongo mmele gwango oguboigwa kamagambu ginu ntendanga yene kukungombokela.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uhyo kuboka pukulye ngabatola kikombe ngabalenga, “Chenje kikombe cha lilagano liyono lyanaya kwa myai jango. Ntendanga yene kila punnywe, kukungombakela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Magambu kila pannie nkate gongo nu kunywela kikombe chenje, ntangachanga kiu cha Angwana, mpaka pabapakuika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwa yene, kila ojwalye nkate gongo andaje kunywela kikombe cha Angwana pangapaligwa, apakube na malemwa kummele na myai ja Angwana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kila mundu akiwachila mwene oti, kuboka penia alya nkate andaje kunywela kikombe chenie. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gambu ojwalye nu kunywe pangamanya mana ga mmele gwa Angwana, anywe nu kulye hukumu jakwe mwene. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nga mana akajingi panakati jinu akatamwe nu kunyililika, nabange bandu bawilangite. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ikabi tukipemite tubene kwa mbone kabi tuhukumuligweje. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu anda tuhukumuligwe na Angwana, tuboligwa tube na ichima, tukaika kuhukumuligwaje pamwe na dunia. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwa, yene makalongo bango, pankongananga kulye chakulya cha Angwana, ntenda kulendana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Na anda mundu jwajwoa abi na njala, alyeoti kachakwe, kupala kongana kwinu kukammekanga muhukumuje. Nambu gange gala, nimpaganga milandu pambakuika.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Itoi kuboka ku Uhuke jwa Chwapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ngoe makalongo bango, mbala mmanyange kipola nhwalo gu itoi ya Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mmanyi kutenda, pamakiba tango nu kummanyaje Nnoongo, ngannongaleigwa mundela mbaja kugongale inyepe yangaoto kulongela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mbala mmanyange kutenda abije mundu ojwalongaleigwa na Uhuke jwa Nnoongo ojwaoto kulenga, “Yesu abekigwe nhwilo!” Uhyo, mundu jwajoa kuotoje kulenga “Yesu nga Nngwana,” pangalongoigwa na Uhuke jwa Chwapi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Itoi ya kihuke itekulekania, nambu Uhuke ojwapanga jumwe tu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ibi ndela ndu ikubegelela, nambu Angwana nga bamwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gabi maengo ndu gukamula nambu Nnoongo jumwe tu, ojwaotoya bandu boa kamwa maengo goa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kila mundu apata kitoi cha Uhuke kwa magambu ga kajangata bandu boa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Uhuke ampe jumwe kube na nhwalo gwa malango, jonge ampe nhwalo gwa maboulo, apapala Uhuke ujwo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uhuke ujwo ampe jumwe imani, jonge ampe kitoi chu kulamiya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Uhuke ampe jonge mundu kitoi chukulaya ikobo, jonge mundu ampe lilobe lya Nnoongo, jonge mundu ampe uwecho gu kumanya maengo ga Uhuke na gangabe maengo ga Uhuke, kumpe jonge kitoi chu kulongela kilonge kiyono na jonge mundu kulandulila kilonge chenie. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu Uhuke ujwo jumwe ojwakamu maengo genia goa, kummagulila kila mundu kitoi chachoa chela andi papala.</para>
  <para style="s">Mmele gumwe nambu ipagwa ndu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Andi pubi mmele gumwe guna ipagwa nduu, ipagwa yenie iganukube nduu, ipangania mmele gumwe, nga apibile kwa Kilisto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Natwe tubi uhyo, tube Akayahudi andaje bandu banga Akayahudi, takabanda andaje takangwana, tuboa ngutubatichigwa Kuhuke jumwe mu mmele gumwe, tuboa ngutunywe Uhuke ujwo jumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mmele upanganigwa kukipagwa chimwe tuje nambu ku ipagwa ijingi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lukongono anda lulenga, “Magambu nenga lubokoje, bai ne nammeleje,” bo, kwa magambu genia ibakotoka kube lwammele? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na ikabi lichikilo lilengite, “Magambu nenga nalioje bai ne nammeleje,” bo, kwa magambu genia ibakotoka kube lyammele? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ikabi mmele gwoa lio, gukaotolabo kujoa? Ikabi lyoa lichikilo, gukaotolabo kunuya? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu Nnoongo abekite ipagwa yoa mummele gwa mundu andi papaile jwombe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nambu yoa ikabi kipagwa chimwe, mmele gukaba koo? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Andi pibi, ukweti ipagwa ijingi, mmele gumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lio kuotoje kululenge luboko, “Nampaije mwe!” Mutwe kuotoje kugalenge makongono, “Nampailingije mangweto!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kupeta genia, ipagwa yenge ya mmele eibonekana kube kunyililika, yenie nga eipaligwa muno. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kabe ipagwa yenge eimpemele kube ipaligweje kupata ichima muno, nga eituigoya muno, ipagwa ya mmele eibonekana kube yamboneje nga eituibeka gwicho muno. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ipagwa yenge ipaligweje kuigoya. Mwene Nnoongo aubekite yenie mmele, ngakipe ichima muno kipagwa chache chikipungwike ichima. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kupala ipagwa ikikibaganaje ipagwa yoa ijangatane. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda kipagwa chimwe kitamwe ipagwa yoa kubinia pamwe na chenie. Anda kipagwa chimwe kilumbaligwe yoa kuala mojo pamwe na chenie.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yene mangweto mmoa nga mmele gwa Kilisto na kila mundu kipagwa cha mmele gwenio. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nnoongo abekite mulikanicha, kutumbu achandundame kuika akalondoli ba Nnoongo kuika akaboli kuika abalaya ikobo, uyo na boa abalamiyanga naboa abaotolanga kajangata bange na boa bina itoi ya kube achilongoi na boa abalonge kilonge kiyono. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bo, boa nga achandundame? Boa nga akalondoli? Boa akaboli? Boa balayanga ikobo? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bo, boa nga bina kitoi chikulamiya? Bo, boa nga bina itoi yu kulonge kilonge kiyono? Bo, boa bamanyangite kulandulila kilonge kiyono? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yene mpalange muno itoi eibi ikolongwa. Nane ngoe nannayanga ndela yambone kupeta yoa.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mapalano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ata nakalongi kilonge cha bandu na cha akapakachi kuboka kumbengu na anda na mapalanoje nenga mbi andi lilobe lya lidebejika andaje njuga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kabe, nhotwi kube na kitoi cha kutangacha nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, nu kumanya ilebe yoa iigwe, nhotwi kube na imani ju kuiboya itombi nambu anda ngwetije mapalano, ne kileje. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nhotwi kupanga ilebe yango yoa yangweti kakaocho nukuboya mmele gwango utinike mwoto nambu anda na mapalanoje genia kuchataje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Juna mapalano kuimbalila nu kube na kia, juna mapalano bwiuje, na kukilumbaje nu kulokalokaje. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Juna mapalano ligouje nu kupalaje ilebe yajika nu kubeje nililaka nu kombakelaje mabaja. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Juna mapalano kualalije mabaja, nambu kuala mojo mukweli. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Juna mapalano kuimbalila goa nu kuamini goa nu kulimba mwojo kwa goa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mapalano gapelaje ngu. Anda kibi kitoi cha kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, mmanya ipa kuboka lichoba limwe tu, anda kitoi cha kulonge kilonge kiyono, ipa kupela, anda kubi kuboola, kupa kupeta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Magambu tumanyi kachoko na tukweti kitoi cha kutangacha lilobe lya Nnoongo kachoko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu pikipakuika chache chikilenganile, kichokochoko chela kipakuboka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kingobu panakiba namwana, nalongela kingota nu kumanya kwango kingota nu kuwacha kwango kingota. Nambu ngoe mbi nanahota ilebe yoa ikingota nilekite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chitikibona ngoe andi kiwili tu mulindala, nambu makiika kingobu matuibona lio kwa lio. Ngoe manyi kachoko tu nambu makiika kingobu manya yoa chwapi andi Nnoongo pamanyi nenga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa ngoe ibi ilebe yenje itatu imani nukuhyobalela na mapalano nambu kikolongwa muno mapalano.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Itoi kuboka ku Uhuke jwa Chwapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nkachana kube na mapalano. Uhyo nnokalela yenge itoi ikiuhuke, muno mpate kitoi chu kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mundu ojwalonge kilonge kiyono alonge na banduje nambu alonge na Nnoongo, gambu abije mundu jwamanya. Jwenio alonge kwa makakala ga Uhuke ilebe ikiite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambu juna kitoi chukutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, alonge na bandu magambu ga kajangata na kapeganga mojo na kakweleka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Boa abalonge kilonge kiyono bikijangata bene tu, nambu boa abatangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo bajangata bandu abunhwamini Kilisto boa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nenga kabi mbai mmoa nnongelange kilonge kiyono, nambu kabi mbai muno mmoa mmegange na kitoi cha kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, gambu mundu ojwatangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo jwambone muno kupeta ojwalonge kilonge kiyono, nambu tu anda abi mundu jukulandulila chalongela, yene bandu abunhwamini Kilisto boa baotwi kujangatigwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yene, makalongo bango, anda nhike kachinu nu kulonge kilonge kiyono mpa kupatanga nike? Kibije champakupata, nambu tu anda nannengalinge agaekeligwe kuboka ku Nnoongo andaje ilimu andaje Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo andaje maboulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Andi pibi yombo yangapomola ijemba andi pilimbi andaje kilimba anda ibi kupiaje lilobe kipola. Mundu aotolabo kuumanya nhwambo ogujembigwa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lipenga anda libi kujembaje gwicho beneke ababakukibeka tela kwa ngondo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uhyo namangweto, anda lulimi lwinu lulonge ilebe yangamanyika, bene abapa kumanya channongela? Gambu malobe ginu andi nnonge panyengelejagi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ibi ilonge aina ijingi padunia, ni kibije changa mana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu anda ne manyije mana ga kilonge cha mundu jwajwoa jola yoa ibalongela iba igeni kwangone na mundu jwenio nng'eni kwango. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na mangwetomwe uhyo, kwa magambu mpalanga itoi ya Uhuke, nkachananga muno kupata yae eijangata kachenga bandu boa bi kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa yene, ojwalonge kilonge kiyono annyope Nnoongo apate kitoi chikulandulila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gambu anda ng'ongali kukilonge kiyono mwojo gwango uhyo utenda kugongalela, nambu malango gango gabi kupata kileje. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lele ndendabole nenga? Ng'ongalela kwa kihuke chango, ng'ongelela uhyo kwa malango gango, nyemba kwa kihuke chango uhyo nyemba kwa malango gango. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anda munnumbali Nnoongo kwa kihuke chinu tu anda abi mundu nng'eni ojwabi pangongano apakumanya bole kujeketela pannumba kulenga “Unhyo,” anda amanyije channongela? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kugongale kwinu kwa kunnumba Nnoongo kuotwi kube chwapi nambu jwenio kunnyangata kilebeje. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ne nannumba Nnoongo kukumbe kulongela kilonge kiyono kumpeta mangweto mmoa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nambu mulikanicha mbala muno kulonge malobe nhwano agamanyikana kupala nabolange bange, kupeta malobe elufu ga kilonge kiyono. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, makawachanga andi ingotaje. Kwa mabaja mmegange andi ingota, nambu punhwacha mmaganga andi makinahota. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iandikigwe Mumalagilo ga Musa kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Angwana balenga yene,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kwa ndela ja kilonge kiyono,</para>
  <para style="q">kwang'omo ya akageni,</para>
  <para style="q">manongela na bandu benia,</para>
  <para style="q">ata yene banyoangaje.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yene kitoi cha kulonge kilonge kiyono ngi kiingi, ngiti kwa bandu abaaminije, nambu kwa bandu bangaamini, nambu kitoi cha kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo nga magambu ga bandu abaamini ngiti bangaaminije.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Anda bandu abunhwamini Kilisto boa bakongine pamwe na boa anda batumbu kulonge kilonge kiyono, anda baike bandu akageni andaje bandu bangahyobalela, bo, balengaje mangweto kube nkweti machonjo? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nambu boa anda batangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, andaike mundu nng'eni andaje jwangahyobalela goa agapakujoa gapakulaya ubaja gwakwe mwene, goa agapakujoa gapakunhukumula. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ilebe yoa iikiite umojo jakwe ibakubonekana, najwenio apakilikitila nu kung'ongale Nnoongo kulenga, “Kweli Nnoongo abi pamwe na mangweto.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pipaligwa mulikanicha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, tulenga nike? Pankongana pamwe, jumwe ajembe nhwambo, jonge abolage, jonge alenga ilebe iiigwe kuboka kwa Nnoongo, jonge alongela kilonge kiyono na jonge alenganakia agalongaligwa. Goa gaba kwa magambu ga kajangata bandu ba likanicha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Anda babi bukulonge kilonge kiyono, balongela abena andaje atatu, akajonjake jongije, nambu alongela jumwe jumwe na kongo aba mundu jonge jukulandulila agalongaligwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu anda abije mundu junkunnandulila agalongeligwa, bai, ojwalonge kilonge kiyono akotoke pangongano penia, alonge mwene tu na Nnoongo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Akalondoli ba Nnoongo, balondola abena andaje atatu na kongo bandu bange bagapeme malobe ga benia. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu anda mundu jumwe pangongano akalongelaga na jonge kati ja abapenakia aekuligwe Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo bai jwajo ojwalongela akotoke. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mmoa nhwotwile kutangacha Nhwalo gwa Nnoongo, jumwe jumwe, kupala kila mundu aotole kukibola alimbe mojo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ihuke ya akalondoli kajoa akalondoli. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Gambu Nnoongo ngiti Nnoongo jwa kijongaje, nambu jwa tengela, uhyo andi pibile mumakanicha goa ga bandu ba chwapi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Akikege batame nuu pangongano. Bapaligwaje kulongela, bapaligwa kube ni ichima, andi pagalenga Malagilo ga Akayahudi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Anda bapala kumanya kilebe chachoa chela, bakonya akangwanamundu kachabe. Gambu oni munkege kulonge milikanicha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bo, nkita lilobe lya Nnoongo liboke kwinu mangweto andaje linhwikili mangweto jika jinu? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Anda abi mundu jwajwoa akipemele kube jwenio nga nnondoli jwa Nnoongo andaje akweti kitoi cha Uhuke, amanya kutenda ganuandikila mangweto gano malagilo ga Angwana. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nambu mundu anda agabembwile genia na jwenio abembuligwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yene makalongo bango, mpaligwa kube na chuna cha kutangacha lilobe lya Nnoongo, nambu mukunkanakiaje mundu kulonge kilonge kiyono. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nambu kila kilebe kitendigwe kuichima na maha.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ngoe makalongo bango mbala kunkombake, Nhwalo Gwambone ogunantangachilanga mangweto, namangweto ngumupokela nu kugwenio nnyemangite kwambone. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ku Nhwalo Gwambone gwenio mangweto nkomboligwe, na ngunhwagabala malobe ganantangachilinge nu kutenda yenieje kuamini kwinu kukaba jagi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nankamuinge mangweto ilebe yambone muno kwinu einipokile, kutenda Kilisto awa kwa magambu ga mabaja gito, andi piandikigwe Mumajandiko ga Chwapi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kutenda ngabanchika nu kuyoka lichoba lya itatu, andi apiandikigwe Mumajandiko, <verse number="5" style="v"/>penia ngampiti Kefa kuboka penia ngabapitila achandundame boa komi na abena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabapitila akalongo akajingi kupeta bandu mia nhwano kingobu chimwe, ajingi kati jabe babilingite tango bakalama mpaka ngoe, nambu bange bajomokinge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngampiti Yakobo na achandundame boa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pukujomolela ngambiti nenga andi namundu namelwike tango kingobu chakwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Magambu nenga nachokochoko kupeta achandundame boa na mbaligweje kemigwa nandundame kwa magambu nakapoteka bandu bikikuta cha Nnoongo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu upeele gwa Nnoongo undei mbe andi pambile nu upeele gwambile ukiba guhyoje. Nenga ngamwi maengo kapeta boa, ngiti neje nambu upeele gwa Nnoongo ogukamwi maengo pamwe nane. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu ata ikabi nenga andaje akajango abatangacha, chenie nga echinhwamini.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lele anda itangachigwa kutenda Kilisto ayoigwe kuboka kwa abawile, bange bandu kati jinu baotwabo kulenga kita kuyoka kubije? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda kuyoka kubije, bai, Kilisto ayokiteje, <verse number="14" style="v"/>anda Kilisto ayokiteje kuboka kwa abawile, kutangacha kwito kwamboneje na imani jinu jambonije. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Elo genia tuje twenga tubonekana kube takachalakichi buhwangi nnongi ja Nnoongo, gambu tulenga kutenda Nnoongo nganhyoya Kilisto kuboka kwa abawile na kumbe jwombe anhyoiteje anda kweli bandu abawile bayoigwaje. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gambu anda abawile bahyoigweje, mmanya na Kilisto ahyokiteje. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na anda Kilisto ahyoigweje, mmanya imani jinu ja jagi, mmi tango mumabaja ginu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Uhyo abajomokinge pamwe na Kilisto baobangite boa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anda kuhyobalela kwito kwa Kilisto kubi kwa bwomi gongo tu mmanya twenga nga tubandu bukutukokalekea kupeta bandu boa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kweli Kilisto ayoigwe kuboka kwa abawile, jwenio nnembu gwa boa abawile. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Andi yene kiu padunia ajambukiya mundu jumwe, uhyo kuhyoka kuboka kwa abawile padunia ajambukia mundu jumwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Gambu kupete Adamu bandu boa baweganga nu kupete Kilisto bandu boa babaganga mmomi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu kila mundu na paali pakwe, kutumbu Kilisto kuika bandu bakwe kingobu apapakubuja Kilisto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuboka pa genia, kubakuika kupela penia Kilisto apakakamuya kingwana chabe Awawa ana Nnoongo, kuboka pa kuboya kila utawala nu uwecho na makakala. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gambu Kilisto apa kutawala mpaka apapakapeta na kabeka akangondwa bakwe pae ja makongono gakwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kiu nga nngondwa jukujomo komigwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Majandiko galenga, “Nnoongo abekite ilebe yoa pae ja makongono gakwe.” Nambu Majandiko pagalenga, “Ilebe yoa ibekigwe pae ja makongono gakwe aitawale,” ilebe yenie ngiti pamwe na Nnoongoje, magambu jwenio nga ojwaibeka ilebe yenie pae ja Kilisto. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu kingobu apapakubeka ilebe yoa ku utawala gwa Kilisto, penia Mwana nga apapakukibeka pae ja Nnoongo, ojwabekite ilebe yoa pae jakwe, kupala Nnoongo atawale gwicho ilebe yoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Anda kuyoka kubije, bo bandu ababatichigwa magambu ga abawile bahyobale kupata nike? Anda abawile bayoigweje, kwa nike bandu babatichigwa kwa magambu gwabe? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na twenga kwa nike kukibeka mukioya kila kingobu? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, nikibeka mukuwe kila machoba! Kukiluya kwango kwinu mangweto kukulondana na Yesu Kilisto Angwana bito indenda ndangache kilebe chenje. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ikabi kupala kwango kukiba kimundumundu tu, kujomana kwango ni inyama ikale ku Efeso nakapata nike? Anda abawile kuhyokaje, bai, “Tulye tunywe magambu malabo tupakuwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Makakoloigwaje, “Maganja mabaja kualabia itendwa yambone.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nnyimukange! Ntumbalange kutama kwambone andi pampaligwa nkotokange kutenda mabaja. Bandu bange kati jinu bummanyije Nnoongo. Nannengalanga genia kunkoyanga oni mangweto.</para>
  <para style="s">Mmele gukuhyoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nambu mundu aotwi konya, “Abawile kuhyoka bole? Babakube na mmele nike?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwenio konya kukutokamala! Mbeju yampanda kumalikaje mpaka iwe oti. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yampanda mapeije nambu mbeju tu, ibe mapemba andaje yenge tu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nnoongo aipe mbeju yenie mapei agapala mwene, kila mbonji ibe yannyika jakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na mibele ja kila chekipanganiigwe kulandanaje. Mibele ja bandu jannyika na mibele ja inyama jannyika na mibele ja ijuni jannyika na mibele ja chamaki jannyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yene jibi mibele ja kumbengu na mibele ja padunia, nu kualala kwa mibele ja kumbengu kwannyika nu kualala kwa mibele ja padunia kwannyika. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lichoba ni kialala chakwe na mwei ni kialala chakwe na ndondwa ni kialala chakwe na ata ndondwa ilekine kulala kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yene nga paipakube kuhyoka kwa bandu abawile. Mmele apubuchika, ube mmele gualabika nambu puhyoka ube gwangaalabika. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Apuchikigwa, ube guna oni nambu uhyoka kukibumo, uchikigwa gwanga makakala uhyoka guna makakala. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Apuchikigwa ube mmele gwa kimundumundu uhyoka mmele gukihuke. Kubi mmele gukimundumundu uhyo ubi mmele gukiuhuke. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Malagilo galenga, “Mundu jukutumbula, Adamu, ngabe mmomi,” nambu Adamu jukujomole nga Uhuke ojwapanga bwomi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Gutumbula mmele gu kihukije, nambu mmele gukimundumundu, kuika mmele gu kihuke. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mundu ju kutumbula, apanganigwa kwa mandope, na abokila mulundope, nambu ngaika mundu jonge abokita kumbengu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Boa ababi ba padunia babi andi jwajo ojwapanganigwa kwa mandope uhyo boa ababi ba kumbengu babi andi jwajo ojwaika kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Andi yene putulandine na mundu ojwapanganigwe kulundope uhyo tubakulandana na jwajo ojwaboka kumbengu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, channenga chenje, mmele na myai kuotoje kulichi kingwana cha Nnoongo, chukualibika kuotojo kulichi ilebe yanga alabika. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nnyoanga, nannengelanga chili, twenga tujomoka tuboaje, nambu tuboa tubakugalambuigwa, <verse number="52" style="v"/>piliba kujemba lipenga lya kujomolela, kukujitukila, bandu abawile mabahyoigwa ni mibele jiba jangawe kabena na twenga matugalambuigwa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Gambu kila kilebe chikialabika mpaka ote kibe changaalabika, mmele gukuwe ube mmele gwangawe. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kingobu mmele gongo guna kualabika pupakube gwanga alabika na chache chukuwe pikipakube changawe, penia nga pilipakulenganila lilobe lela eliandikigwa Mumajandiko, kulenga, “Kiu kialabigwe nu uwecho!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>“Mwe makiu, uwecho gwinu ubiko?</para>
  <para style="q">Mwe makiu, ubiko uchungu gwinu gukupoteka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Uchungu gwa kiu nga mabaja na makakala ga mabaja nga malagilo. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nambu tunnumbe Nnoongo ojwatupi uwecho kupete kwa Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto! <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yene makalongo bango manampala, nyemange gwicho na kwa makakala. Nkachane kila kingobu na maengo ga kabegele Angwana andi mmanyiela kutenda maengo gankamula ka Angwana gaoba jagije.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chango ya akaumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ngoe kunhwalo gwa chango ya ela kwa magambu ga kape bandu ba Nnoongo, ntendanga andi panalagalinge bandu ba makanicha guku Galatia. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila Jumapili kila mundu abeke ela tela na apapata, kupala gukabeje michango kingobu pambakuika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kingobu pambakuika kwinu, nakinga bandu abampa kachagula kati jinu bapeleke balua na hupo inu Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Anda ipaligwe kujenda na nenga, tijabulanga nanenga.</para>
  <para style="s">Mawacho ga Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mainka kwinu kuboka pa kupete Kamakedonia magambu mbakupete kwenio. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mbemele nitama kwenio kwa machoba machoko pangaje nitama machoba goa ga malili, kupala unyangatange mumwanja gwango kokotikola okumbakujenda. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbaije kupeta kwinu chokwechokwe nu kujendeke na mwanja. Mbemele mandama kwinu machoba majingi anda Angwana bapaile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu mba upamba pa Efeso mpaka lichoba lya Pentekoste. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pamba napabona pabi kipola pukamu maengo gango gambone, iganukube abangana babilingite ndu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Anda aike Timoteo makammeka kube na mbweleje, magambu jwenio akamu maengo ga Angwana andi pangamu nenga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makammembulaje, nambu munyangate ajendeke na mwanja gwakwe kwa tengela kupala aoto kubuja kwango, magambu twenga tutenda kunnolela aike na akalongo bito. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apolo nnongo gwito, ndekumpembela muno kupala aike kwenio pamwe na bange abanhyobale Nnoongo, apaije kuika machoba gano, nambu maika kwenio anda aotwile.</para>
  <para style="s">Malobe gu kupela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkelukiange, ntamanga maha muimani jinu, nkachanange nu kube na makakala. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kila chankamula nkamulanga kwa mapalano. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mikimanyi kibelei cha Stefano, angweto bakiba bukulongalela kupokela lihyobalelo lya Kikilisto kukilambo cha Kuakaya, ni bikibekangite beneakangweto kabegelela bandu ba Nnoongo. Nanyopanga makalongo bango, <verse number="16" style="v"/>mikibekange pae ja ulongochi gwa bandu andi benia na mulongochi gwa kila mundu ojwakamu maengo nu kubegelela pamwe nangweto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nhala mojo muno kutenda Stefano na Fatunato na Akaiko baikangite, baibangite lilanga elikiba gwanga beganga gwinu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bikialali kiuhuke chango na kiuhuke chinu uhyo. Yene ipaligwa kakombakela bandu andi benia. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bandu boa ba kukilambo chuku Asia abahyobale Nnoongo bampatanga abali. Akula na Pilisika pamwe na bandu ba likanicha boa ababilingite munyumba jabe bampatanga abali ku lina lya Angwana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akalongo boa bampatanga abali. Namangweto uhyo mpatananga abali kukiingi cha mapalano ga Nnoongo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nenga Napaulo nampatanga abali, andika balua kuluboko lwango namwene. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa jwangapala Angwana, abekigwe nhwilo. Angwana nhwike! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Upeele gwa Angwana ana Yesu ube pamwe na mangweto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mapalano gango gabe pamwe na mangweto mammi nkati ja Yesu Kilisto.</para>
</usx>
